The architecture also draws on patterns described by OpenHands and brain.md:

- OpenHands software-agent-sdk — MIT-licensed upstream project —
  https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk. Gipypowers uses the published
  project as a design reference for explicit task state, bounded recovery, and
  host-owned tool execution. No upstream code was copied.
- brain.md — Apache-2.0-licensed upstream project —
  https://github.com/mindmuxai/brain.md. Gipypowers uses the published project
  as a design reference for repo-native Markdown memory, indexing, and selective
  retrieval. No upstream code was copied.

